# Private materials — DO NOT COMMIT
# Maps anonymized Reviewer N labels back to original GitHub handles.
_PRIVATE_*.md
_PRIVATE_*.txt
_PRIVATE_*.csv

# macOS metadata
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
._*

